# notation/bpmn/process-components - What takes part in this BPMN model?
#
# Answers: the model's flow elements grouped into the categories a reader actually
# asks about - where work arrives, what runs automatically, what a person does,
# who the participants are, what data is touched, and where it ends.
#
# Does NOT prove: that any of it runs. A ServiceTask is a modelled intent to call
# something, not evidence that a service exists, is deployed, or is reachable. Nor
# does it prove completeness: a process drawn at one level of detail hides the
# systems a more detailed one would name.
#
# notation/bpmn/process-flow answers the adjacent question - the sequence flows
# between elements, as edges. Use that for order, this for participants.
#
# Membership comes from {{MEMBERSHIP:element}}, so it follows whatever the profile
# says "belongs to this model" means: graph co-location for converter output, or a
# bounded folder walk for a store that authors the chain. Hand-writing a folder path
# here is what this directive exists to stop.
#
# The category list is the vocabulary, not a guess. Types absent from the model
# simply produce no rows for that category; a category is never invented, and a type
# outside the list is not silently dropped into "other" - it is left out, so adding
# a BPMN construct here is a deliberate edit rather than an accident of matching.
#
# Categories are numbered so a plain sort reads in the order a process happens:
# arrival, automation, human work, participants, data, outcome.
#
# Parameters: MODEL_IRI, LIMIT
{{PREFIXES}}
SELECT ?category ?element ?label ?type ?nativeId
WHERE {
  {{GRAPH_OPEN:semantic}}
    VALUES ?model { {{MODEL_IRI}} }
    VALUES (?type ?category) {
      (bpmn:StartEvent            "1 arrives")
      (bpmn:IntermediateCatchEvent "1 arrives")
      (bpmn:ReceiveTask           "1 arrives")
      (bpmn:ServiceTask           "2 automated")
      (bpmn:ScriptTask            "2 automated")
      (bpmn:SendTask              "2 automated")
      (bpmn:BusinessRuleTask      "2 automated")
      (bpmn:UserTask              "3 human")
      (bpmn:ManualTask            "3 human")
      (bpmn:Task                  "3 human")
      (bpmn:Participant           "4 participant")
      (bpmn:Lane                  "4 participant")
      (bpmn:DataObject            "5 data")
      (bpmn:DataObjectReference   "5 data")
      (bpmn:DataStoreReference    "5 data")
      (bpmn:EndEvent              "6 outcome")
      (bpmn:IntermediateThrowEvent "6 outcome")
    }
    {{MEMBERSHIP:element}}
    ?element a ?type .
    OPTIONAL { ?element {{PATH:label}} ?label }
    OPTIONAL { ?element {{PATH:native_id}} ?nativeId }
  {{GRAPH_CLOSE}}
}
ORDER BY ?category ?label ?element
LIMIT {{LIMIT}}
